## Citation hygiene

- Vendor API docs rotate. Field names, defaults, and even the presence of `semantic_vad` can shift across minor releases. When a specific parameter matters, cite the dated page and archive your evidence.
- Marketing benchmark numbers from any stack are published in their best conditions. Replicate on your own corpus before citing a number in a decision.
- Open-weights model performance claims should cite the model card + the paper. The model card is the artefact that ships; the paper is the methodology behind it.
- Compliance posture (HIPAA, GDPR, etc.) applies to your audio collection from day one, not just at production deployment. Verify before you build the Chapter 5 corpus from real sessions.
